{"pin":"BH03785","subcodes":[{"code":"BH03785","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be unto God! Through divine grace and mercy thou hast attained the shore of the Most Great Ocean and art present before the Throne. This bounty [3.5s]... ...O my God! I beseech Thee by Thy name whereby Thou hast subdued the hearts of men, O Thou Well-Beloved, to grant that I be ever content","first_line_orig":"الحمد لله بفضل و رحمت الهی بشاطی بحر اعظم وارد شدی و تلقاء عرش حاضر این فضل  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"240","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11096#111","source":"BLIB_Or11096","locator":"111"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA23:203","source":"INBA23","locator":"203","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v023/?page=120"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM1#031 p.072x","source":"ADM1","locator":"031 p.072x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/557.pdf#page=72"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQA6#235 p.134","source":"AQA6","locator":"235 p.134","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/567.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"KHMI.089","source":"KHMI","locator":"089","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/677.pdf#page=104"},{"kind":"translation","code":"JHT_S#120x","source":"JHT_S","locator":"120x","url":"https://joshuahalltranslations.com/jalal/2017/10/Supplications-by-Bahaullah-1.pdf#page=56"}]},{"code":"BH03785PLE","anchor":"ple","translations":[{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}]}]}
